# Build output of scripts/build-web.sh. Nothing in here is ever committed —
# this file is the ONLY tracked entry, and it exists solely so the directory
# survives a fresh clone: //go:embed all:dist in ../assets.go fails to compile
# against a missing directory.
#
# There is deliberately no placeholder index.html: assets.go detects the
# not-yet-built case at runtime and serves a "run scripts/build-web.sh" page,
# so there is no build artifact to accidentally commit and no clean-up step
# to remember before committing.
*
!.gitignore
